­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­ ­&nbsp;</div><table class=\"x_2117018028nl-container\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"><tbody><tr><td><table class=\"x_2117018028row-1 x_2117018028row\" align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td><table class=\"x_2117018028row-content x_2117018028stack\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-radius: 0; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 500px; margin: 0 auto\" width=\"500\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"x_2117018028column x_2117018028column-1\" width=\"100%\" style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 100%\"><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"x_2117018028col-pad\" style=\"padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; padding-top: 5px\"><table class=\"x_2117018028image_block x_2117018028block-1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr>\r\n<td class=\"x_2117018028pad\" style=\"width: 100%; padding-top: 60px; padding-bottom: 60px; padding-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px\" align=\"left\"><div style=\"max-width: 171.5px\"><img src=\"https://userimg-assets.customeriomail.com/\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; border: 0; width: 100%\" width=\"171.5\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" height=\"auto\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"x_2117018028block-2 x_2117018028text_block\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"x_2117018028pad\"><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif\"><div style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(82, 82, 82); line-height: 1.4\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\">Hi there,<br><br>\r\nOn October 30, ten days from now, Supabase will stop automatically granting Data API access to <strong>new tables</strong> in the \"public\" schema for existing projects.<br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px\"><strong>Your existing tables are not affected.</strong> They keep their current grants and stay accessible through the Data API.</p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px\"><strong>What changes on October 30</strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px\">Any table created in \"public\" from that date onwards needs an explicit GRANT before supabase-js, PostgREST, or GraphQL can reach it. Without one, the API returns a \"permission denied\" error that includes the statement to run.<br><br>This includes migrations that recreate your schema: new projects, preview branches, and local \"supabase db reset\".<br><br><strong>What to do<br><br>\r\n</strong>Add grants in the same migration that creates each table:<br></span></p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"x_2117018028block-3 x_2117018028html_block\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"x_2117018028pad\"><div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: center\" align=\"center\"><table width=\"90%\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin: 16px auto\">\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 248, 250); border: 1px solid rgb(208, 215, 222); border-radius: 6px; padding: 16px; font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;, Courier, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(36, 41, 47); text-align: left !important\">\r\n      <span style=\"color: rgb(5, 80, 174); font-weight: bold\">grant</span> select<br>\r\n      <span style=\"color: rgb(5, 80, 174); font-weight: bold\">on</span> public.your_table<br>\r\n      <span style=\"color: rgb(5, 80, 174); font-weight: bold\">to</span> anon;<br>\r\n      <br>\r\n      <span style=\"color: rgb(5, 80, 174); font-weight: bold\">grant</span> select, insert, update, delete<br>\r\n      <span style=\"color: rgb(5, 80, 174); font-weight: bold\">on</span> public.your_table<br>\r\n      <span style=\"color: rgb(5, 80, 174); font-weight: bold\">to</span> authenticated;<br>\r\n      <br>\r\n      <span style=\"color: rgb(5, 80, 174); font-weight: bold\">grant</span> select, insert, update, delete<br>\r\n      <span style=\"color: rgb(5, 80, 174); font-weight: bold\">on</span> public.your_table<br>\r\n      <span style=\"color: rgb(5, 80, 174); font-weight: bold\">to</span> service_role;<br>\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</tbody></table></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"x_2117018028block-4 x_2117018028text_block\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"x_2117018028pad\" style=\"padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 20px; padding-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px\"><div style=\"font-family: sans-serif\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 1.5\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px\">Check which tables are exposed in your project's <a href=\"https://email.supabase.com/\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(23, 23, 23)\" target=\"_blank\">Data API settings</a>.</span></p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"x_2117018028text_block x_2117018028block-5\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"x_2117018028pad\" style=\"padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 20px; padding-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px\"><div style=\"font-family: sans-serif\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 1.5\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><a href=\"https://email.supabase.com/\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(23, 23, 23)\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Learn more about this change\">Learn more about this change</a></span></p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"x_2117018028text_block x_2117018028block-6\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"x_2117018028pad\"><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif\"><div style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(82, 82, 82); line-height: 1.4\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px\">If you have any questions, please reach out to our <a href=\"https://email.supabase.com/\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(23, 23, 23)\" target=\"_blank\">support team</a>.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px\">The team at Supabase</span></p></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"x_2117018028row x_2117018028row-2\" align=\"center\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"><tbody><tr><td><table class=\"x_2117018028row-content x_2117018028stack\" align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(52, 52, 70); width: 500px; margin: 0 auto\" width=\"500\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"x_2117018028column x_2117018028column-1\" width=\"100%\" style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 100%\"><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"x_2117018028col-pad\" style=\"padding-bottom: 5px; padding-top: 60px\"><table class=\"x_2117018028block-1 x_21170